<title>USA: Telepassport IPO postponed -- underwriter.</title>
<headline>Telepassport IPO postponed -- underwriter.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The planned initial public offering in Telepassport Inc was postponed due to market conditions, lead underwriter CS First Boston said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The initial public offering proposed five million shares at an estimated price range of $14 to $16 under the ticker symbol &quot;TEPP&quot; on the Nasdaq National Market.</p>
<p>Telepassport deals in the telephone communications industry.</p>
</text>
